      "dimension": "controller_platform",
      "reason": "Laser War uses Data East CPU/driver hardware, not a Williams System 11 board. No reviewed pinmame.dataeast controller profile exists yet.",
      "would_resolve": "A reviewed Data East controller profile derived from pinned source and original board documentation."
